 13:   - operation:显影裁剪, clip_reveal
 14:   - operation:重涂色, recolor
 15:   - object:隐形矩形, hidden_rectangle
 16:   - object:对角角点对, diagonal_corner_pair
 17:   - relation:包含, containment
 18:   - relation:交叠重涂, overlap_recolor
 19:   - condition:仅他框内部显影, reveal_only_inside_other
