  8: ## 1. 锚定环序异或
  9: 
 10: - 参考题目: 2, 9, 20
 11: - tags:
 12:   - operation:异或, xor
 13:   - operation:相位对齐, phase_alignment
 14:   - object:矩形边界, rectangular_border
